### ============================================================================
### Player Scout API — 04. Motor Analítico Recursivo & Modo Comparativo (A vs B)
### ============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1

# Substitua pelos UUIDs gerados ou utilize o 99_full_e2e_workflow.http:
@actorId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003
@playerId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000010
@matchId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000020

### 1. Agregação Recursiva — Histórico Completo do Atleta (Carreira)
# @name analyticsCareer
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/players/{{playerId}}?actor_id={{actorId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Agregação Recursiva — Filtro por Partida Específica
# @name analyticsByMatch
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/players/{{playerId}}?actor_id={{actorId}}&match_id={{matchId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Agregação Recursiva — Filtro por Set Específico (Set 1 da Partida)
# @name analyticsBySet1
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/players/{{playerId}}?actor_id={{actorId}}&match_id={{matchId}}&set_number=1
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Agregação Recursiva — Filtro por Período Cronológico (ISO 8601)
# @name analyticsByPeriod
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/players/{{playerId}}?actor_id={{actorId}}&from_date=2026-01-01T00:00:00Z&to_date=2026-12-31T23:59:59Z
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. Modo Comparativo Lado a Lado — Set 1 (Escopo A) vs Set 2 (Escopo B)
# @name compareSet1VsSet2
POST {{baseUrl}}/analytics/compare
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actor_id": "{{actorId}}",
  "player_id": "{{playerId}}",
  "scope_a": {
    "match_id": "{{matchId}}",
    "set_number": 1,
    "from_date": null,
    "to_date": null
  },
  "scope_b": {
    "match_id": "{{matchId}}",
    "set_number": 2,
    "from_date": null,
    "to_date": null
  }
}
